  "changes": [
    "Emit shared scripts and CSS as fingerprinted assets; retain essential theme initialization inline.",
    "Cache production build collection reads and return independent arrays; bypass caching in development.",
    "Index actual content bodies; retain tag, archive, collection, and pagination routes without duplicate search results.",
    "Load desktop Live2D only on explicit visitor click; remove the unused automatic WebGL diagnostic.",
    "Replace 100ms TOC polling with cached geometry, passive scroll events and one update per frame. Re-measure on content resize and entrance animation completion.",
    "Observe back-to-top content resizing and batch progress updates; animate signatures only in view and honor reduced motion.",
    "Apply long immutable browser caching only to fingerprinted assets and search fragments. Keep HTML/search entry defaults, request CV revalidation at the Pages origin, and version CV links to handle custom-domain overrides.",
    "Generate versioned bilingual Academic CV download URLs from the PDF content hash to avoid stale browser caches under custom-domain TTL overrides."
